msgid ""
"After the [Learning Path](../0-overview/2-learning_path.md) and [Getting "
"Started](../1-getting_started/0-index.md), continue by **role**. This "
"chapter is a set of short learning paths: who you are, then ordered links"
" into existing How-To, Concepts, and Reference pages."
