#: ../../source/6-more_applications/0-index.md:22
#: b2f6e263069342518ee2cd84573e09ba
msgid ""
"Public robots on this path include **ARX** (方舟无限) **Lift 2S** (full-body "
"mobile manipulator) and **Acone** / **AC One** (dual-arm). **HighTorque**"
" (高擎) **Panthera HT** is a dual-arm manipulator. Product how-tos: [ARX "
"Lift 2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md), "
"[HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)."
msgstr ""
"公开路径上的机器人包括 **方舟无限 Lift 2S**（全身移动操作臂）和 **Acone** / **AC One**（双臂）。**高擎 "
"Panthera HT** 是双臂操作臂。产品操作指南：[方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)、[高擎 "
"Panthera HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)。"
